Third-party tools (declared, not vendored)
------------------------------------------
The published featurization tools GloriPaka builds on are declared as optional
dependencies and cited, not bundled. Their model weights are downloaded from the
original sources at first use, so no third-party model files are stored here:

  - NanoBodyBuilder2 (via the ImmuneBuilder package) - structure prediction
  - ANARCI / anarcii - IMGT numbering
  - FreeSASA - solvent-accessible surface area
  - DeepSP (Lai Lab, MIT) - SAP/SCM surface-patch predictions
  - ESM2 (fair-esm) - protein language-model embeddings (optional)

Each retains its own license. See the documentation for full citations.

Data availability
-----------------
Third-party datasets are cited, not redistributed. The Ginkgo / PROPHET-Ab
(GDPa) measurements in particular are NOT included in this repository or in any
associated Zenodo deposit; the documentation records their provenance and how to
obtain them from the original source. Only data we generated ourselves, and that
is license-clear, may be shared via Zenodo.
